[{"client_msg_id":"85971423-2bfb-4b97-aaf1-4cbf81ba82f4","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Python 製の Language Server を使う、なんかの issue で対応した気がするんですが、それっぽいですね。例えば Win 以外なら Language Server が起動してる状態で新しく更新、リスタートしてもOKだけど。Winだと一回、ちゃんとプロセス切って(サーバー停止)から更新しないと駄目みたいなそんなのを思いだしました。点が線でつながった。","ts":"1636701428.350100","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1636701454.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KBzTp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c78abc64-63b1-4b14-bf3e-5da3ca46b2d7","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なるほど \u0026lt; raa0121","ts":"1636701256.347900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kth"}]},{"client_msg_id":"119c8595-3a1c-4712-9d9c-00ec44cbb6be","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Windows はプロセスがファイル持ってると、中身書き換えられないからですね","ts":"1636701150.347700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PDo7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f8562ed-d1ff-4c75-ae24-297b22ff6a59","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なるほど","ts":"1636701129.347200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pi8+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31228570-86f5-429b-a8c0-cc8cd144ac82","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"pythonコマンドから呼ばないとだめ、あった気がします","ts":"1636701061.346700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q4TGd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac1fded1-0ecf-4e5a-abe4-e0440e833ab2","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"とりあえず Win ではなんかあった気がするのはたしかな記憶","ts":"1636700956.346000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AIh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4f8b3d4-a6d1-448d-a549-3f9351f806aa","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`venv/Scripts/pip install -U pip` は駄目で `venv/Scripts/pyth