eam":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uCgbq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9304497-3ce1-4256-af1e-a472f248e403","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あー、なるほど。たしかに pip 自体の更新でコケたことあるかもしれない気がしてきました(ちなみに今、手元にWinない)","ts":"1636700474.341600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9tH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a457f6d7-f967-4a9e-9a8f-586394ad55c5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"pip自体の更新はpip叩けない、というのはありますが、他もあるのかな?","ts":"1636700378.341400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WAFn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37acb72e-b9c9-48c2-8f84-775c84884de9","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`venv/Scripts/python -m pip install ...` みたいな","ts":"1636700265.340900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TfR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c224684f-bd89-42c3-aa90-0c290f19584b","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Windows ってグローバルに叩ける pip で直接じゃなくて venv の python 自体の pip で `python -m pip install XXXX` ってやらないとパーミッションエラーが出るパターンとかあった気がしなくもない","ts":"1636700172.340700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s5o57"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88fc31f1-1074-413a-9737-cb81cff010a5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"PermissionErrorとかだったら、その下になった操作に対してセキュリティイベントがでてそうな気もするけども…","ts":"1636698073.340100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s7+N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da9cab91-e101-4e95-9624-010bec065e35","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いやまあリンクというか本家のコマンドを実行しちゃうから、(成果ファイルはローカルに置かれるとしても)なにかエラーするかも?と思っただけなので...","ts":"1636697899.337900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IHFI"}]},{"client_ms